# Airsup / Supi revert

If the user asks to **revert**, **remove**, or **uninstall** Airsup / Supi / agent discovery on tademehl.com:

1. Read and follow `airsup/REVERT.md`
2. Run: `node airsup/revert-airsup.js`
3. Review the git diff (only Airsup markers/files should change)
4. Commit and push to `origin main` (project rule), unless the user says not to
5. Verify homepage has no Supi logo and key pages still work

Do not invent a different revert path. Do not leave orphaned `AIRSUP-BEGIN` blocks.
